### Create a new application
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "country": "Germany",
  "university": "TU Munich",
  "program": "MSc Computer Science",
  "scholarship_amount": "1000 EUR/month",
  "tuition": "0",
  "gpa_requirement": 3.0,
  "toefl_requirement": 90,
  "deadline": "2026-12-15",
  "visa_country": "Germany",
  "sub_role": "AI",
  "acceptance_score": 7.5,
  "notes": "Strong fit based on coursework"
}

### Get all applications
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/applications